Date: Thu, 10 Sep 2026 04:51:05 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/6] [Model] DeepSeek V4.1 / SRA release (squashed)

Squashed 50 commits from oss-release into a single commit for review.
Includes DeepSeek V4.1 model support (text, VL, spec decoding), SRA
infrastructure, Engram, MegaMoE, sparse MLA, and related fixes.

